{"parse":{"title":"个性/血之欢愉","pageid":8416,"revid":20970,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E8%A1%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%AC%A2%E6%84%89&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E8%A1%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%AC%A2%E6%84%89&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E8%A1%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%AC%A2%E6%84%89&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>血之欢愉</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E8.A1.80.E4.B9.8B.E6.AC.A2.E6.84.89\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"血之欢愉\"><b>血之欢愉</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">个性详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"个性 血之欢愉.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/5/5c/88dlbpsv1957056g3fgk1d5ujygigh7.png/80px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7_%E8%A1%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%AC%A2%E6%84%89.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/5/5c/88dlbpsv1957056g3fgk1d5ujygigh7.png/120px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7_%E8%A1%80%E4%B9%8B%E6%AC%A2%E6%84%89.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/5/5c/88dlbpsv1957056g3fgk1d5ujygigh7.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />血之欢愉\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:60%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"强韧\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">强韧</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"震慑反击\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">震慑反击</font></span></span>]，拥有技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"猩红锁链\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">猩红锁链</font></span></span>]。<br />✦无视[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"冰冻\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">冰冻</font></span></span>]地形格影响，拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"无视守护•寒境\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">无视守护•寒境</font></span></span>]效果。<br />✦主动攻击后：自身受到<font color=\"#ed7950\">30%</font>当前生命值的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"穿透伤害\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">穿透伤害</font></span></span>]，对敌人施加1层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"流血\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">流血</font></span></span>]（持续1回合）、1层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"伤口\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">伤口</font></span></span>]（持续3回合）。<br />✦最大生命值提高<font color=\"#58cb48\">10%</font>，魔攻提高<font color=\"#d68fe2\">5%</font>。<br />✦拥有光环：场上所有受到[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"流血\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">流血</font></span></span>]或[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"血棘之种\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">血棘之种</font></span></span>]的敌人，最终伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">4%</font>，最终受到伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">4%</font>。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><b>该个性属于</b><br /><br /><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:90px;height:90px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%A1%9E%E5%A8%9C\" title=\"角色图鉴库/塞娜\"><img alt=\"头像 塞娜.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/2/2c/gk5xl4lk65d1ejg085shrrggybf1da0.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:90px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">塞娜</font></div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性二星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80