ite-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"血棘之种\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">血棘之种</font></span></span>]的敌人，最终伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">7%</font>，最终受到伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">7%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性三星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"强韧\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">强韧</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"震慑反击\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">震慑反击</font></span></span>]，拥有技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"猩红锁链\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">猩红锁链</font></span></span>]。<br />✦无视[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"冰冻\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">冰冻</font></span></span>]地形格影响，拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"无视守护•寒境\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">无视守护•寒境</font></span></span>]效果。<br />✦主动攻击后：自身受到<font color=\"#ed7950\">30%</font>当前生命值的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"穿透伤害\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">穿透伤害</font></span></span>]，对敌人施加1层[<span style